Package: yunpanel
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: Yunsoft <admin@yunsoft.com>
Depends: adduser, ca-certificates, certbot, curl, git, libc6, libstdc++6, nginx, openssh-client, xz-utils
Description: Yunsoft server and hosting control plane
 YunPanel provides an authenticated Node.js management API, privileged local
 host runtime and restricted web dashboard used to manage Yunsoft hosts.
 The legacy yun-agent service remains packaged only for controlled migration
 until local execution owns the full operation set.
